title Build → test → image → compose up → health gates — **what actually exists, and what does not**\nGround truth: **there is no CI of any kind**. Every green step below is a human typing a command.\n(evidence: infra-tests §17 — no `.github/`, no `.gitlab-ci.yml`, no `Jenkinsfile`, no `.circleci/`,\nno `Makefile`, no `pytest.ini`/`pyproject.toml`, no pre-commit config, no coverage tooling · git history = 1 commit `87b0643`)

start

