  #EDE9FE:**developer edits code on the DGX Spark host**\nrepo is a single commit `87b0643 first commit`\nworking tree: 18 modified + 16 untracked files; <<manual>>
  #FEE2E2:**«MISSING» no CI trigger**\nno push / PR / tag hook exists anywhere.\n`git ls-files | rg -i 'ci|workflow|jenkins|pipeline'` → only `citations` paths; <<missing>>
}

partition "**2 · STATIC GATES**" {
