  #FEE2E2:**«MISSING» no type-check gate**\n`npx tsc --noEmit` is documented as a //manual// step\n(frontend/README.md:39); no mypy for Python (`.mypy_cache` ignored, tool absent); <<missing>>
  #FEE2E2:**«MISSING» no dependency / CVE scan**\nno Dependabot, no `pip-audit`, no `npm audit` gate,\nno SBOM, no container image scan; <<missing>>
